✅ 正确：'“换衣服成为维京战士，同时保留面部特征”'\n\n### 构图位置改变\n❌ 错误：'“把他放在海滩上”'\n✅ 正确：'“将背景更改为海滩，同时保持人物处于完全相同的位置、比例和姿势”'\n\n### 风格应用不准确\n❌ 错误：'“使其成为草图”'\n✅ 正确：'“转换为具有自然石墨线条、交叉影线和可见纸张纹理的铅笔素描”'\n\n## 核心原则\n\n1. **具体明确** - 使用精确描述，避免模糊词汇\n2. **分步编辑** - 复杂修改分为多个简单步骤\n3. **明确保留** - 说明哪些要保持不变\n4. **动词选择** - 用\"更改\"、\"替换\"而非\"转换\"\n\n## 最佳实践模板\n\n**对象修改：**\n'“将 [对象] 更改为 [新状态]，保持 [要保留的内容] 不变”'\n\n**风格转换：**\n'“转换为 [特定风格]，同时保持 [构图/角色/其他] 不变”'\n\n**背景替换：**\n'“将背景更改为 [新背景]，保持主体处于完全相同的位置和姿势”'\n\n**文本编辑：**\n'“将'[原始文本]'替换为'[新文本]'，保持相同的字体样式”'\n\n> **记住：** 越具体越好，Kontext 擅长理解详细指令并保持一致性。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "TextInput_", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [408.89447021484375, 869.35400390625], "pos": [-2773.368408203125, 1655.2005615234375], "id": 426, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "TextInput_", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [1800], "label": "STRING", "type": "*", "localized_name": "STRING"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["", "", "."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text1"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text1", "link": 1795, "label": "text1", "type": "STRING"}, {"widget": {"name": "text2"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text2", "link": 1796, "label": "text2", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text Concatenate", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [315, 126], "pos": [-1605.3876953125, 2634.556884765625], "id": 434, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CR Text Concatenate", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [1801], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["Based on the above text content, maintain the description of the main body and rewrite it according to the following structure:"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "TextIn